{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":47,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴比伦的覆灭"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"“处女巴比伦啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"下来坐在尘土中吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女迦勒底啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坐在没有宝座的地上吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你必不再称得上娇柔细嫩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要推磨磨面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"揭下面纱，掀起裙子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"露出大腿，涉水过河。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必赤身裸体，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"露出羞处。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必报仇，不放过一人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们的救赎主是以色列的圣者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂名叫万军之耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"“迦勒底少女啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要默默地坐着，进入黑暗中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你不再被称为列国之后。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾向我的子民发怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让我的产业被玷污，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他们交在你手中。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你对他们毫不留情，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至让老人负极重的轭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你声称要永远做王后，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不把这些事放在心上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不思想以后的结局。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"“淫逸安舒的人啊，听着！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你自以为天下无双，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必不致寡居，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不会遭丧子之痛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁知两件事却在同一天忽然临到你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使你施展许多邪术和符咒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寡居和丧子也必全然临到你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"“你肆无忌惮地行恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自以为没有人看见。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你被自己的聪明智慧欺骗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自以为天下无双。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必大祸临头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不知如何祛灾避祸。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"灾祸必落在你身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无可挽回。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你意想不到的祸患必突然来到。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"“你自幼就勤练符咒和五花八门的邪术，继续施展吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也许会有用处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也许会令人害怕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众多的计谋使你疲惫不堪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让那些观天象、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每月说预言的占星家来救你脱离将临的灾祸吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"“看啊，他们不过像碎秸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必遭焚烧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无法救自己脱离烈焰。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这火并非取暖的炭火，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不是人可以靠近的火。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你自幼交往并一同劳碌的占星家帮不上你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们都各陷迷途，无人救你。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/47.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/48.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/46.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}